      "content": "hi can you help me write a formal letter to my landlord in berlin? my radiator is broken and it's gotten really cold in the apartment. i need to tell the hausverwaltung that the heating element isn't working and i want them to fix it ASAP. i want it to sound professional and firm so they actually take it seriously.",
