      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but i think i need it to be a bit more \"official\" sounding to make sure they don't just ignore it. can you add a sentence or two mentioning that according to german rental law, i'm entitled to a reduction in rent (Mietminderung) if the heating isn't fixed within a reasonable timeframe? also can you make the tone a bit more assertive/stern? i want them to know i know my rights.",
